codes or links.\n                </p>\n                <p style=\"margin:16px 0 0 0;\">Best regards,<br />The Crypto.com Team</p>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </table>\n          <div style=\"margin:24px 0 0 0;font-size:12px;text-align:center;color:#cccccc;\">Crypto.com | Blog | App | Exchange</div>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n    </table>\n  </body>\n</html>"
