    "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <title>Verify Your FCA Representative</title>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%!important;height:100%!important;background-color:#ffffff;font-family:Verdana,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.62857;color:#3f3f3f\">\n<div style=\"background-color:#ffffff;width:100%\">\n <table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;margin:0;padding:0\">\n  <tr>\n   <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:0\">\n    <table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"600\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;max-width:600px;margin:0 auto\">\n     <tr>\n      <td style=\"padding:24px 20px 20px 20px;background-color:#ffffff\">\n       <table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\">\n        <tr>\n         <td align=\"left\" style=\"padding:0\">\n          <img src=\"cid:fcalogo\" alt=\"Financial Conduct Authority\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%\">\n         </td>\n        </tr>\n       </table>\n      </td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n      <td style=\"padding:32px 20px 24px 20px;font-family:Verdana,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.62857;color:#3f3f3f\">\n       <p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;padding:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.62857;color:#3f3f3f;font-family:Verdana,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;white-space:nowrap\">{{DATE}}</p>\n       <p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;padding:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.62857;color:#3f3f3f;font-family:Verdana,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Dear {{RECIPIENT_NAME}},</p>\n       <p style=\"margin:0 0 32px 0;padding:0 0 20px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e0e0e0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.62857;color:#3f3f3f;font-family:Verdana,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\"><strong style=\"font-family:Verdana,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:700;color:#6c1d45\">Verification of Assigned FCA Representative – Reference {{REFERENCE_NUMBER}}</strong></p>\n       <p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;padding:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.62857;color:#3f3f3f;font-family:Verdana,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">This correspondence formally confirms that <strong style=\"font-family:Verdana,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:700;color:#3f3f3f\">{{REPRESENTATIVE_NAME}}</strong> is an authorised representative of the Financial Conduct Authority and is duly authorised to act on behalf of the FCA in relation to Reference {{REFERENCE_NUMBER}}.</p>\n       <p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;padding:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.62857;color:#3f3f3f;font-family:Verdana,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">In accordance with Financial Conduct Authority policies and procedures, {{REPRESENTATIVE_NAME}} has been appointed as the assigned representative for this matter and is authorised to liaise with you as the primary point of contact.</p>\n       <p style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0;padding:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.62857;color:#3f3f3f;font-family:Verdana,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:700\">The assigned representative is authorised to:</p>\n       <ul style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0;padding:0 0 0 24px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.62857;color:#3f3f3f;font-family:Verdana,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">\n        <li style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;padding:0\">Act as the nominated point of contact for matters relating to this case</li>\n        <li style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;padding:0\">Request, receive, and assess information relevant to the matter</li>\n        <li style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;padding:0\">Provide updates regarding the status and progression of the case, where appropriate</li>\n        <li style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;padding:0\">Conduct enquiries and regulatory actions in relation to this matter</li>\n        <li style=\"margin:0;padding:0\">Respond to questions and provide information as the case progresses, subject to legislative and operational constraints</li>\n       </ul>\n       <p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;padding:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.62857;color:#3f3f3f;font-family:Verdana,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">This verification applies solely to Reference {{REFERENCE_NUMBER}} and the representative named above. Please ensure that the representative's name and reference number correspond with the details provided by the individual with whom you are communicating.</p>\n       <p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0;padding:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.62857;color:#3f3f3f;font-family:Verdana,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">The Financial Conduct Authority appreciates your cooperation in this matter.</p>\n       <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0;padding:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.62857;color:#3f3f3f;font-family:Verdana,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Yours faithfully,</p>\n       <p style=\"margin:0;padding:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.62857;color:#3f3f3f;font-family:Verdana,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Financial Conduct Authority</p>\n      </td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n      <td style=\"padding:24px 20px;font-family:Verdana,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#76777b;text-align:center;background-color:#f0f1f4\">\n       <p style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0;padding:0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#76777b;font-family:Verdana,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Financial Conduct Authority<br>12 Endeavour Square<br>London E20 1JN</p>\n       <p style=\"margin:0;padding:0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#76777b;font-family:Verdana,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">© 2026 Financial Conduct Authority. All rights reserved.</p>\n      </td>\n     </tr>\n    </table>\n   </td>\n  </tr>\n </table>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
  },
  {
